  "releaseNotes": "19.1.1\n* Updated dependency to core library 19.1.1\n* Updated PDFsharp-extended dependency to 1.4.0\n\n19.1.0\n* New PdfUtils.ExtractTextFragments() returns text with position, page and font size (PdfTextFragment)\n* ExtractText() now reproduces the page layout line by line\n* More robust font decoding for real-world encoding dictionaries and malformed ToUnicode maps\n* Updated dependency on FactoorSharp.FacturX to 19.1.0",
